We've published a press release about something we've done for a while: putting our website prices where anyone can see them. You can read the [full release on openPR](https://www.openpr.com/news/4666885.html).

## Why publish prices?

Plenty of web designers only give a price after a call or a long form. That makes it hard to compare options, and harder still to know whether it's worth asking at all.

"One of the first things people want to know when they get in touch is how much a website is going to cost," said Nathan Constance, founder of NC Digital. "Not every business needs a big, complicated website. Some just need a professional site that explains what they do and makes it easy for customers to contact them. I want people to be able to see the options and have a rough idea of the cost before they even speak to me."

## What our websites cost

All prices include VAT:

- **One-page WordPress website:** from £199
- **Multi-page WordPress website:** from £600
- **Ecommerce website** (WooCommerce, Shopify or SureCart): from £800
- **Pay-monthly website:** £20, £35 or £50 a month, with no upfront cost, the domain and hosting included, and a 6-month minimum term
- **Hosting for a website you own:** £25 a month or £250 a year
- **Maintenance plans:** £50, £75 or £99 a month
- **Local SEO:** from £200 a month, with no contract

Since the release went out, we've also set a starting price for multi-page websites, so they now start from £600 rather than being priced individually.

## Get a rough figure first

If you're not sure which option suits you, our [website cost calculator](/website-cost-calculator/) gives you an instant, no-obligation estimate. For a full breakdown of what's included, terms and ownership, read [how much web design costs in Cardiff](/blog/how-much-does-web-design-cost-in-cardiff/).

NC Digital was founded in 2025 in Merthyr Tydfil by Nathan Constance, who has worked as a web developer for 11+ years. We work with businesses across South Wales, and Cardiff is one of our main service areas. See our [web design for Cardiff businesses](/web-design-cardiff/) page for our prices and recent work.

